#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:37
#: 961df324448e4df19aa9c183d917e34c
msgid ""
"Read in `on_init` from `info_.hardware_parameters`. No "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback` (or README does not claim a hot update)."
" Change the xacro and restart the hardware / `controller_manager`."
msgstr ""
"在 `on_init` 从 `info_.hardware_parameters` 读取。没有 "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`（或 README 未声明可热更新）。改 xacro 并重启硬件 / "
"`controller_manager`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:37
#: de4111561b514df2aedd3d860632b00d
msgid "**Runtime**"
msgstr "**运行时**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:37
#: 3b053e848f4a400d9e1b132797c180ff
msgid ""
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`, or a README + source path that re-reads"
" `ros2 param set` without reload (HighTorque kp/kd poll)."
msgstr ""
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`，或 README + 源码路径表明 `ros2 param set` "
"无需重载即可生效（HighTorque 的 kp/kd 轮询）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:55
#: da37e0949eb041f6a650823bde1c1431
